# S6 step 1: the schema rename. The application entities, the DbContext set and the stored
# ceremony parameters. Everything else that says "tenant" is step 2.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   dotnet run --project scripts/s6-rename -- scripts/s6-rename/step1.map
#
# Not renamed here, on purpose: the audit entities (AuditLog, AuditAcme/Cmp/Est/Msae/Network/Scep
# keep TenantId; the audit database is verbatim), SignerAuditEntity.TenantScope (the persisted
# 'tenant' token), and every DTO, request and response type (the API is step 3).

